 to be seen by people and avert [them] from the way of Allāh. And Allāh is encompassing of what they do.","j":10,"h":19,"s":8,"a":47,"sd":null},{"k":"8:48","t":"And [remember] when Satan made their deeds pleasing to them and said, \"No one can overcome you today from among the people, and indeed, I am your protector.\" But when the two armies sighted each other, he turned on his heels and said, \"Indeed, I am disassociated from you. Indeed, I see what you do not see; indeed, I fear Allāh. And Allāh is severe in penalty.\"","j":10,"h":19,"s":8,"a":48,"sd":null},{"k":"8:49","t":"[Remember] when the hypocrites and those in whose hearts was disease [i.e., arrogance and disbelief] said, \"Their religion has deluded those [Muslims].\" But whoever relies upon Allāh - then indeed, Allāh is Exalted in Might and Wise.","j":10,"h":19,"s":8,"a":49,"sd":null},{"k":"8:50","t":"And if you could but see when the angels take the souls of those who disbelieved... They are striking their faces and their backs and [saying], \"Taste the punishment of the Burning Fire.","j":10,"h":19,"s":8,"a":50,"sd":null},{"k":"8:51","t":"That is for what your hands have put forth [of evil] and because Allāh is not ever unjust to [His] servants.\"","j":10,"h":19,"s":8,"a":51,"sd":null},{"k":"8:52","t":"[Theirs is] like the custom of the people of Pharaoh and of those before them. They disbelieved in the signs of Allāh, so Allāh seized them for their sins. Indeed, Allāh is Powerful and severe in penalty.","j":10,"h":19,"s":8,"a":52,"sd":null}],"juz":10,"hizb":19,"surahs":[8],"sajdah":false}